'''Road to Unification''' (天下統一への道 ''Tenka-Tōitsu no Michi'', '''Road to Unification''') is an event originally released as part of [[Nyanko Daisensou|BCJP]]'s [[Anniversary/12th Year|12th Anniversary]]. In [[The Battle Cats|BCEN]] [[Version 14.4 Update|14.4]], it was added as a standalone event unrelated to any anniversary.

==Event Information==
The new event {{Color|#4A86E8|'''"Road to Unification"'''}} is available now!<br>
Clear every event Mission added by the end of Week 5 to earn one {{Color|#0000FF|'''Platinum Ticket'''}}!<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''Week 5'''}} events are available now! Check out the Missions Tab in the Cat Base for more info!

※ You must clear Empire of Cats Ch. 1 stage Japan to unlock Road to Unification stages and Missions.<br>
※ If the event does not appear, please update to the latest version of The Battle Cats.<br>
※These Special missions can only be completed until July 25th (10:59am), so don't forget to claim your rewards before then!

{{Color|#FF9900|'''・Limited "Road to Unification" stages available!'''}}<br>
Challenge new stages and face down renowned commanders on the road to unification!<br>
All stages have a set maximum {{Color|#FF0000|'''War Fund'''}} limit that will affect the units that can be deployed.<br>
Clearing a stage will earn War Funds that will allow for more units to be deployed. Use those funds to advance your Cat Army!<br>
Visit the Special Stages section of the Legend Stages to challenge these event stages.

※Stages with limited Money also prevent certain CatCombos effects from activating. Refer to the list below for CatCombos effects that will not activate.<br>
- Starting Money UP<br>
- Worker Cat Wallet UP<br>
- Worker Cat Start Level UP<br>
- Accounting Power UP<br>
※The maximum amount of War Funds that can be held is 999,999.

{{Color|#FF9900|'''・"Road to Unification Pt. 1" stages and missions on now!'''}}<br>
Set out with your Cat Army to unify the warring states!<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''On between June 20th (11:00am) and July 25th (10:59am)!'''}}<br>
Earn {{Color|#4A86E8|'''battle items, Rare Tickets, and War Funds'''}} based on your score when clearing a stage!

Also, cleared stages have a small chance of featuring the extra stage, {{Color|#4A86E8|'''"Doge's Rebellion."'''}}

Check for the text "Urgent Stage available!" to know if the stage has appeared! Clear the stage and suppress the uprising to earn War Funds!

[[File:2025 tenkatouitsu ss01 en.png|center|link=]]

▲Check for the raging flames to know if "Doge's Rebellion" is accessible.

New limited Missions for Road to Unification Pt. 1 are also available! Check the Mission Tab in the Cat Base for more details on the first week of Missions!<br>
Increase your War Funds and unify all of the warring states of the Cat Empire!

※Check the Timed Score Reward in the bottom left of the stage select screen to check the rewards for clearing stages.

{{Color|#FF9900|'''・"Engage! Commander Nyandam" stages and Missions now available!'''}}<br>
The most daring and powerful commander leads their army against the Cats!<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''On between June 27th (11:00am) and July 25th (10:59am)!'''}}<br>
Earn {{Color|#4A86E8|'''items, Cat Tickets, and War Funds'''}} based on your score when clearing a stage!

Special Missions for "Engage! Commander Nyandam" are available from the Missions Tab in the Cat Base. Missions for Week 2 can be accessed from the Missions Tab in the Cat Base.

The names of the Cats will be etched into the annals of history... should they be victorious!

※Check the Timed Score Reward in the bottom left of the stage select screen to check the rewards for clearing stages.

