==Mechanics==
Each stage in this event starts the player off with 4,500¢ and doesn't allow the player to earn any money from the [[Worker Cat]] or defeating enemies. This is in fact the same mechanic as in [[Otherworld Colosseum]]'s Trust Fund rule. Each stage drops "War Funds" (軍資金), which will increase the initial 4,500¢ starting money, unlike in the Colosseum.

