==Trivia==
*Since Road to Unification was released in [[The Battle Cats|BCEN]] before its 11th Anniversary, but was originally part of the [[Anniversary/12th Year|12th Anniversary]], BCEN players were effectively able to play the 12th Anniversary's content before the 11th Anniversary.
*Since they contain [[Revolutionary Nobunaga]], the names of the Despot's Ambition stages may reference the ''[[wikipedia:Nobunaga's Ambition|Nobunaga's Ambition]]'' series of games.

